OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of seagrass shoots found
OL,4,Ain estuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 430 seagrass shoots have been
OL,7,Fdiscovered in the Fowey Estuary, giving
OL,8,Fconservationists hope that one of the
OL,9,FUK's most important marine habitats can
OL,10,Fbe brought back to Cornwall's waters.
OL,12,FThe new growth was recorded across 50
OL,13,Fpatches of seabed during summer surveys
OL,14,Fcarried out by Cornwall Wildlife Trust.
OL,16,FThe findings come despite fears the
OL,17,Frestoration trial might not succeed
OL,18,Fwhen only six seedlings had emerged by
OL,19,Fthe end of April.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
